5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure we make a decision based on evidence rather than optimism, I would like to examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the board minutes on a jointly run clinic.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I believe we must first understand the physical and digital capacity of our infrastructure. I will examine the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, as well as what the booking system records.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent start, Toshio. To ensure our ambitions are not merely castles in the air, I shall examine the data agreements with outside surgeries and the board minutes on a jointly run clinic.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm so happy to be here with you all! I want to make sure the people working on these programs are doing okay, so I'll look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to be in your company. To ensure our vision is grounded in reality and sustainable for the years to come, I shall examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I believe our current selection of records is comprehensive. By balancing the operational data with the historical outcomes of previous trials, we can avoid repeating past mistakes. I am satisfied with these choices.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. We have covered the physical constraints, the staffing levels, and the financial framework. I believe this breadth of data will allow us to see if a proposal is truly viable.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A multifaceted investigation is the only way to ensure we aren't simply polishing a flawed diamond. I believe we have cast a wide enough net to capture the necessary truths.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I totally agree! It's so great that we're all looking at different things. I can't wait to see what we find out so we can pick the best program for everyone!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom teaches us that a house is only as strong as its foundation. By looking at both the resources we possess and the value they return, we shall ensure our choice flourishes long after the first year.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have all agreed on our respective areas of investigation, I believe there is no further need for deliberation in this round. I am ready to review the findings.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I concur. The division of labor is clear and the scope is sufficient. I am ready to proceed to the findings.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Quite. Since we have reached a consensus with such remarkable efficiency, I shall also declare myself ready. Let us see if the archives are as cooperative as our conversation has been.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm ready too! I'm super excited to see what the records tell us about our amazing staff. Let's go find some answers!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
19,1,3,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
20,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I share your readiness. Let us move forward with a spirit of openness and curiosity, trusting that the truths we uncover will guide us toward a decision that serves the greater good. I am ready.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
